ible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TMSAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{TMSAT}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cb0c882121f853e4\" href=\"?note=cb0c882121f853e4\" title=\"28-df-tmsat\">28-df-tmsat</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NPComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\)</span> 使用本目录多项式时间多一归约，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7a9125ebbfdef91e\" href=\"?note=7a9125ebbfdef91e\" title=\"28-df-np-complete\">28-df-np-complete</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TMSAT}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TMSAT}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>成员资格：猜u并用通用机模拟给定机器至t步，通用模拟开销是实例长度与t的多项式。NP难性：固定待归约NP语言的多项式时间非确定机N；确定型V以u为全部猜测位逐步模拟N，猜测长度p(|x|)取N的多项式时钟（不足处忽略尾位）。输出〈V,x,1<sup>{p(|x|)},1</sup>{q(|x|)}〉，q为包含验证器全部分支的多项式时钟。它可多项式时间输出且接受条件保持。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 2.9；印刷 pp.43–44 / PDF pp.69–70。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tmsat","status":"resolved","id":"cb0c882121f853e4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tmsat]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"7a9125ebbfdef91e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tmsat","status":"resolved","id":"cb0c882121f853e4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TMSAT}$ 见 [[